{"id":"5d2dec526682fb65","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-kleene-t-predicate.md","title":"Kleene T Predicate","display":"df-kleene-t-predicate — Kleene T Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","aliases":["88-df-kleene-t-predicate"],"display":"df-kleene-t-predicate — Kleene T Predicate","depends_on":["[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-tm-initial-configuration]]","[[88-df-tm-computation]]","[[88-df-tm-output]]","[[88-df-tm-run-encoding]]","[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-kleene-t-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kleene-t-predicate — Kleene T Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" href=\"?note=3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" title=\"88-df-tm-initial-configuration\">88-df-tm-initial-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25d15dae418e51ef\" href=\"?note=25d15dae418e51ef\" title=\"88-df-tm-computation\">88-df-tm-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b301b626e1a834ac\" href=\"?note=b301b626e1a834ac\" title=\"88-df-tm-run-encoding\">88-df-tm-run-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>，保留已固定的机器族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^{(k)}=(M_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal M^{(k)}=(M_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，并明确要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M^{(k)})\">\\(\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M^{(k)})\\)</span>；描述码、有效性、完整覆盖及原始递归条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a>。下式仍由同一族机器诱导 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (program index)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span> (arity); <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span> is the partial function induced by this same machine numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> (input tuple)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (binary input word, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (code of a finite halting computation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{runenc}_{M_e^{(k)}}(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\">\\(\\operatorname{runenc}_{M_e^{(k)}}(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\)</span> (run code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b301b626e1a834ac\" href=\"?note=b301b626e1a834ac\" title=\"88-df-tm-run-encoding\">88-df-tm-run-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathsf{out}}\">\\(U_{\\mathsf{out}}\\)</span> (run-output extractor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b301b626e1a834ac\" href=\"?note=b301b626e1a834ac\" title=\"88-df-tm-run-encoding\">88-df-tm-run-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Init}_{M_e^{(k)}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x),C_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Init}_{M_e^{(k)}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x),C_0)\\)</span> (initial-configuration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" href=\"?note=3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" title=\"88-df-tm-initial-configuration\">88-df-tm-initial-configuration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computation}_{M_e^{(k)}}(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Computation}_{M_e^{(k)}}(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\)</span> (finite computation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"25d15dae418e51ef\" href=\"?note=25d15dae418e51ef\" title=\"88-df-tm-computation\">88-df-tm-computation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e^{(k)}}(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e^{(k)}}(w)\\)</span> (partial output function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"fff1247dc8d93b4d\" href=\"?note=fff1247dc8d93b4d\" title=\"88-df-tm-output\">88-df-tm-output</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^{M_e^{(k)}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^{M_e^{(k)}}\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^{M_e^{(k)}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^{M_e^{(k)}}\\)</span> (halting-state projections, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\">\\(T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\\)</span> (Kleene computation predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{T_k}:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_{T_k}:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (characteristic function of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\nT_k(e,\\vec x,t)\n\\leftrightarrow\ne,t\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\n\\land\\exists m,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\;\n\\Bigl(\nt=\\operatorname{runenc}_{M_e^{(k)}}(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\n\\land\\mathrm{Init}_{M_e^{(k)}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x),C_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Computation}_{M_e^{(k)}}(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^{M_e^{(k)}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^{M_e^{(k)}}\\}\\;\n\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\nC_m=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e^{(k)}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x))\n=\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash\nT_k(e,\\vec x,t)\n\\leftrightarrow\ne,t\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\n\\land\\exists m,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists C_0,\\ldots,C_m\\;\n\\Bigl(\nt=\\operatorname{runenc}_{M_e^{(k)}}(y,C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\n\\land\\mathrm{Init}_{M_e^{(k)}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x),C_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Computation}_{M_e^{(k)}}(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\n\\land\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^{M_e^{(k)}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^{M_e^{(k)}}\\}\\;\n\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\nC_m=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Output}_{M_e^{(k)}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x))\n=\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\forall e,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\chi_{T_k}(e,\\vec x,t)\n\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;T_k(e,\\vec x,t),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg T_k(e,\\vec x,t).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\forall e,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\chi_{T_k}(e,\\vec x,t)\n\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n1,&amp;T_k(e,\\vec x,t),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg T_k(e,\\vec x,t).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\\land U_{\\mathsf{out}}(t)=y)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\\land U_{\\mathsf{out}}(t)=y)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\">\\(T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>编码程序<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>在输入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span>上的完整停机计算</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> : 固定有效程序/机器编号中的程序索引，不是公式语法的 Gödel 编号</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>这里固定的是可原始递归解码的标准句法编号；仅有“通用求值器可计算”的\n任意有效编号不足以推出下游特征函数仍为原始递归。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在标准有效编码下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span>是原始递归谓词，用于Kleene正规形式定理</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>现在通过规范运行码同时携带输出值；不再调用无来源的\n序列解码器。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上面的函数图等式把机器运行码、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span>、输出提取器和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(k)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(k)}\\)</span> 的解释正式连接；它不是仅在注释里声称两套编号相同。非法输出不产生数值函数的图元素。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-initial-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"3f8f3a8be6b88d18","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · 